oss ~0.3-0.5, while failed experiments with custom heads degrade performance. Implementation: import AutoModelForSequenceClassification, instantiate with num_labels=3 and hidden_dropout_prob=0.1, remove the custom class and all references to stylo_dim etc.", "training_evaluation": "Increase epochs to 20, set learning rate to 1e-5 for all parameters (remove differential LRs), remove warmup steps, add cosine annealing scheduler with T_max=20, and keep early stopping patience at 3. This stabilizes training and improves convergence, as supported by similar historical experiments. Implementation: modify optimizer to use a single parameter group with lr=1e-5 and weight_decay=0.01, replace scheduler with CosineAnnealingLR(optimizer, T_max=20), and update NUM_EPOCHS=20, PATIENCE=3."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
